question.en:
What do the two comparisons print?

```python
from dataclasses import dataclass


class Plain:
    def __init__(self, text: str) -> None:
        self.text = text


@dataclass
class Boxed:
    text: str


print(Plain("a") == Plain("a"))
print(Boxed("a") == Boxed("a"))
```

